## Why the two halves differ

The code is worth more shared than withheld, so it is MIT. The footage is the
opposite: a year of driving that cannot be re-shot, and the reason this game can
exist at all.

The two directions are also not equally reversible. A licence, once given, cannot
be withdrawn from copies already distributed — so a permissive grant here would
be a one-way door, while starting closed leaves both moves available. That is the
whole reason this file reads the way it does rather than naming an open licence.

## What this file cannot reach

Round sets used to be committed to this repository, so dashcam frames sit in its
git history from a time when `LICENSE` was the only licence here. Nothing
retroactively relicenses those objects. The media stopped being committed in
[#53](https://github.com/adanalife/guessr/pull/53), so nothing new joins them.
